=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.65</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.35</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The Venn diagram corresponding to this situation is as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-7cb22278f94d2190e63e597604eda249\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/7cb22278f94d2190e63e597604eda249\"></div>\n</div></div>",
